# Student Enrollment & Course Management System (SECMS)

## Overview
A Salesforce Administrator project designed for managing student enrollments, courses, instructors, approval processes, custom reports, and security configurations.

## Features Implemented
- **Custom Objects & Fields:** Students, Courses, Instructors, Enrollments.
- **Automation:** Record Types (Undergraduate & Postgraduate) & Approval Processes.
- **Security:** Profiles, Permission Sets, and Organization-Wide Defaults (OWD).
- **Analytics:** Custom Reports & SECMS Overview Dashboard.

## Project Tracking
